This software interacts with the CROSS WAVE service (https://wave.crosstoken.io)
on the user's behalf — including listing campaigns and missions, signing
authentication challenges with an EOA private key, submitting Shorts/TikTok
video links to missions, and (when the back-end exposes such an endpoint)
claiming accrued $CROSS rewards. Use at your own risk. The authors accept no
liability for rejected mission submissions, slashed referral commissions,
banned accounts, undelivered rewards, or other TOS / financial damage
arising from use of this software. Always test the read-path subcommands
(`info`, `campaigns`, `missions`) and review the bundled scripts before
granting it your private key. Driving a third-party rewards platform
programmatically may violate the platform's TOS — operate only on your
own account and your own wallet.
